Vouwiy
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 15 ROTATE 3 U 3
COLUMN 7 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 4 FACE_HALF

NOBU 1 FACE_LAST
NOBU 7 FACE_LAST
NOBU 3 FACE_LAST
NOBU 1 FACE_LAST
NOBU 4 FACE_LAST
NOBU 8 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {COLUMN, NOBU, DRAW} NOBU
DEST Rank K
MOVE {DRAW, NOBU} COLUMN
AND
    DEST Size >= 5
    OR
        SRC Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS}
        DESTSRC Suit match
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL NOBU Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
